<div class="col fade-in" style="gap: var(--sp-7);">

    <ComponentDocHeader Slug="typography">
        The type scale as a strongly-typed primitive. <code>Variant</code> drives the
        look (size / weight / colour); <code>As</code> independently chooses the rendered
        tag, so an H2-styled heading can be a semantic <code>&lt;h1&gt;</code>.
    </ComponentDocHeader>

